      "step_number": 1,
      "text": "Step 1: First, we need to find the measure of angle ACB. Since the sum of angles in a triangle is 180 degrees, we can calculate angle ACB as follows:\n\\[\n\\angle ACB = 180^\\circ - \\angle BAC - \\angle ABC = 180^\\circ - 54^\\circ - 52^\\circ = 74^\\circ\n\\]",
